{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.poster.avif?t=1763601864\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.webm?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.mp4?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in a sunlit room with soft natural light. Let your troubles drift away as you piece together vibrant puzzles by yourself or with friends in multiplayer! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.poster.avif?t=1763601864\" width=600 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.webm?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.mp4?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a new puzzle is started the pieces are cut from scratch to be a new experience.  No two pieces are alike! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.poster.avif?t=1763601864\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.webm?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.mp4?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated pieces make it easy to match by shape or colors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.poster.avif?t=1763601864\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.webm?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.mp4?t=1763601864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own difficulty.  Select presets from 100, 200, 600, and 1000 pieces.  Or type in any number you want to test your limits! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create puzzles of any size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated piece cuts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 High Resolution Puzzles included for Free</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Images and Illustrations chosen specifically for Jigsaw Puzzles</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradient Puzzle Maker</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own gradient puzzles, as many as you like!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 editable presets included</p></li></ul></li><li><p 